              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "fiji chefmom"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I was very suprised at the nice texture of these cookies. I normally am not a fan of \"cake like\" cookies, but these were incredibly tender and flavorful. Very easy to prepare, and the batter stayed in place while baking. I added flaked almonds which added crunch, and added nicely to the flavor. Kudos to you in your late night cravings and the successful recipe!"
          },
